{"index": 0, "start": 154.35, "end": 160.31, "text": "end of the last great ice age, there arose in the north a powerful queen. Her name was"}
{"index": 1, "start": 160.31, "end": 166.81, "text": "Juliana, and her ambition was to extend her realm to all the regions of the known world."}
{"index": 2, "start": 167.15, "end": 175.19, "text": "To this end, she gathered an army, and she bore a son and named him Necron, and him she"}
{"index": 3, "start": 175.19, "end": 182.51, "text": "tilted in the black arts and in the powers of the mind. And when Necron came of age and"}
{"index": 4, "start": 182.51, "end": 188.51, "text": "attained mastery of those powers, together they seized control of the region of ice."}
{"index": 5, "start": 188.83, "end": 194.69, "text": "And from their castle called Ice Peak, they sent a giant glacier rumbling southward. No"}
{"index": 6, "start": 194.69, "end": 200.63, "text": "village or people could stand against its relentless onslaught. And so the remnants"}
{"index": 7, "start": 200.63, "end": 207.67, "text": "of humanity fled south and huddled for warmth among the volcanoes of a mountain region ruled"}
{"index": 8, "start": 207.67, "end": 212.49, "text": "by a generous king named Gero, from his fortress which made the world a place of peace and"}
{"index": 9, "start": 213.23, "end": 213.95, "text": "tranquility."}
{"index": 10, "start": 215.37, "end": 223.33, "text": "Necron pushed the ice ever southward into the temperate zone toward Fire Keep, and no"}
{"index": 11, "start": 223.33, "end": 231.49, "text": "one dared guess at the outcome of a meeting on the field of battle between fire and ice."}
{"index": 12, "start": 231.85, "end": 284.24, "text": "Hold your positions, men. Steady. It cannot be stopped. Join your brother."}
{"index": 13, "start": 284.42, "end": 421.0, "text": "You have done well, my son. The North Village has fallen."}
{"index": 14, "start": 421.14, "end": 422.44, "text": "We have won."}
{"index": 15, "start": 423.12, "end": 424.92, "text": "I want to thank you, Mother."}
{"index": 16, "start": 425.78, "end": 429.98, "text": "The Great Plain is all that stands between ourselves and Fire Keep."}
{"index": 17, "start": 430.58, "end": 432.44, "text": "That is a long distance."}
{"index": 18, "start": 433.28, "end": 440.3, "text": "A distance we may not have to travel. I am sending our envoys to Gero with our new demands."}
{"index": 19, "start": 440.88, "end": 442.44, "text": "He will not submit."}
{"index": 20, "start": 442.72, "end": 449.32, "text": "Perhaps. You will present our demands to King Gero at Fire Keep, and, uh, give our"}
{"index": 21, "start": 449.32, "end": 451.12, "text": "royal regards to his lovely daughter."}
{"index": 22, "start": 451.14, "end": 778.58, "text": "I will be with you when you meet Necron's men."}
{"index": 23, "start": 778.9, "end": 782.76, "text": "You will serve your people better here with your studies, my daughter. Give me your"}
{"index": 24, "start": 782.76, "end": 782.96, "text": "love."}
{"index": 25, "start": 783.38, "end": 787.41, "text": "You have it always, Father."}
{"index": 26, "start": 787.75, "end": 809.02, "text": "The matter in our world is from the natural bases, which are earth, air, fire, and water."}
{"index": 27, "start": 809.3, "end": 814.75, "text": "The four elements from which all things are created."}
{"index": 28, "start": 815.89, "end": 820.21, "text": "How can you talk about elements when the war draws near to us every hour?"}
{"index": 29, "start": 821.29, "end": 826.97, "text": "Princess Tigra, we all have our duty. Your father's duty is to be king and lead. You"}
{"index": 30, "start": 826.97, "end": 831.97, "text": "Your brother's duty is to soldier, and your duty is to learn."}
{"index": 31, "start": 832.63, "end": 838.61, "text": "You mean my duty is to stay shut up while all the men do the fighting and share all the glory?"}
{"index": 32, "start": 840.55, "end": 845.78, "text": "Well, we think that stinks. Don't we, Shaitan?"}
{"index": 33, "start": 846.38, "end": 850.5, "text": "If you peacefully surrender, my lord Necron will cease the destruction of..."}
{"index": 34, "start": 850.5, "end": 854.38, "text": "This is your message of peace? A demand for our total and unconditional surrender?"}
{"index": 35, "start": 855.3, "end": 858.4, "text": "We call it an offer of alliance, your majesty."}
{"index": 36, "start": 858.4, "end": 860.24, "text": "I call it blackmail."}
{"index": 37, "start": 860.68, "end": 862.88, "text": "My lord Necron's offer..."}
{"index": 38, "start": 862.88, "end": 866.7, "text": "To hell with Necron and his offer. We are free men, not slaves."}
{"index": 39, "start": 868.54, "end": 870.42, "text": "King Jarl, be reasonable."}
{"index": 40, "start": 871.6, "end": 876.6, "text": "My son Taro speaks more with his heart than with his head, but he speaks for all of us."}
{"index": 41, "start": 876.92, "end": 880.46, "text": "There can be no alliance. We will fight you to the death."}
{"index": 42, "start": 882.68, "end": 885.5, "text": "Perhaps you will soon change your mind."}
{"index": 43, "start": 1009.15, "end": 1010.41, "text": "Dragonhawks will find her, father."}
{"index": 44, "start": 1010.41, "end": 1011.65, "text": "They've got to."}
{"index": 45, "start": 1012.71, "end": 1017.51, "text": "A night so dark, a jungle so thick, a bird couldn't find its own nest."}
{"index": 46, "start": 1019.98, "end": 1021.66, "text": "Well, what do we do then, father?"}
{"index": 47, "start": 1024.27, "end": 1025.73, "text": "For Necron's new demands?"}
{"index": 48, "start": 1026.17, "end": 1027.37, "text": "For his siege."}
{"index": 49, "start": 1108.64, "end": 1547.42, "text": "What is your report?"}
{"index": 50, "start": 1548.14, "end": 1550.0, "text": "Have you done as I commanded?"}
{"index": 51, "start": 1550.78, "end": 1553.98, "text": "Have you captured the girl Tigra, Jarl's daughter?"}
{"index": 52, "start": 1554.4, "end": 1556.16, "text": "Where is she?"}
{"index": 53, "start": 1557.18, "end": 1559.54, "text": "Bring her forth that I may see her."}
{"index": 54, "start": 1560.66, "end": 1561.04, "text": "She's gone."}
{"index": 55, "start": 1561.84, "end": 1562.32, "text": "Gone?"}
{"index": 56, "start": 1562.84, "end": 1563.32, "text": "Gone."}
{"index": 57, "start": 1563.8, "end": 1875.26, "text": "What do you want?"}
{"index": 58, "start": 1875.4, "end": 1891.82, "text": "Well, if you want it, take it."}
{"index": 59, "start": 1892.0, "end": 1898.78, "text": "I am not a thief."}
{"index": 60, "start": 1899.1, "end": 2001.47, "text": "Not so close. You'll burn it."}
{"index": 61, "start": 2002.27, "end": 2009.99, "text": "I've always lived close to a fire, sometimes in the night."}
{"index": 62, "start": 2010.75, "end": 2031.82, "text": "I'm so afraid. It's getting colder."}
{"index": 63, "start": 2032.26, "end": 2044.22, "text": "Comes from Necron."}
{"index": 64, "start": 2045.02, "end": 2045.66, "text": "I know."}
{"index": 65, "start": 2045.96, "end": 2058.42, "text": "Where are you going?"}
{"index": 66, "start": 2058.72, "end": 2060.1, "text": "I'm going home to my people."}
{"index": 67, "start": 2064.17, "end": 2064.83, "text": "Where's home?"}
{"index": 68, "start": 2065.09, "end": 2066.65, "text": "Far away, to the south."}
{"index": 69, "start": 2067.41, "end": 2068.61, "text": "I'm going south, too."}
{"index": 70, "start": 2069.25, "end": 2069.73, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"index": 71, "start": 2069.95, "end": 2070.77, "text": "Well, you can come along."}
{"index": 72, "start": 2071.41, "end": 2073.05, "text": "If you behave yourself."}
{"index": 73, "start": 2073.47, "end": 2074.77, "text": "If I behave myself?"}
{"index": 74, "start": 2078.83, "end": 2079.35, "text": "No."}
{"index": 75, "start": 2080.15, "end": 2237.47, "text": "You'll have to kill me first."}
{"index": 76, "start": 2237.73, "end": 2247.79, "text": "For death, boy, it finds us all soon enough."}
{"index": 77, "start": 2248.09, "end": 2256.16, "text": "That your boy was to keep you from killing yourself"}
{"index": 78, "start": 2256.68, "end": 2258.0, "text": "till you're all healed."}
{"index": 79, "start": 2259.24, "end": 2260.34, "text": "You need rest."}
{"index": 80, "start": 2260.64, "end": 2269.49, "text": "And if you're going to kill the Ice Lord, boy,"}
{"index": 81, "start": 2270.19, "end": 2272.15, "text": "you better learn to live with pain."}
{"index": 82, "start": 2275.64, "end": 2276.46, "text": "Ice Lord?"}
{"index": 83, "start": 2277.16, "end": 2278.8, "text": "You mean you're fighting Necron?"}
{"index": 84, "start": 2279.54, "end": 2284.46, "text": "Him and his mother. Bitch, Juliana."}
{"index": 85, "start": 2284.8, "end": 2301.88, "text": "They were here."}
{"index": 86, "start": 2303.42, "end": 2305.1, "text": "Necron's dogs. They got the girl."}
{"index": 87, "start": 2306.54, "end": 2307.68, "text": "They took her west."}
{"index": 88, "start": 2308.08, "end": 2363.55, "text": "They camp less than two miles from here."}
{"index": 89, "start": 2363.97, "end": 2364.49, "text": "Come."}
{"index": 90, "start": 2364.89, "end": 2385.86, "text": "The tigra don't go down."}
{"index": 91, "start": 2386.08, "end": 2386.6, "text": "Tigra."}
{"index": 92, "start": 2386.76, "end": 2514.9, "text": "The girl before."}
{"index": 93, "start": 2515.3, "end": 2517.18, "text": "She's on the far side of the big tree."}
{"index": 94, "start": 2518.46, "end": 2521.26, "text": "You go get her out, and I'll distract the others."}
{"index": 95, "start": 2521.7, "end": 2523.14, "text": "There must be 50 of them."}
{"index": 96, "start": 2524.14, "end": 2525.72, "text": "That sounds about right."}
{"index": 97, "start": 2612.64, "end": 2613.44, "text": "Where's the girl?"}
{"index": 98, "start": 2613.54, "end": 2614.04, "text": "I could..."}
{"index": 99, "start": 2643.23, "end": 2645.01, "text": "No, they'd be on our heels before we could reach them."}
{"index": 100, "start": 2645.39, "end": 2647.01, "text": "But Tigra's still back there."}
{"index": 101, "start": 2647.09, "end": 2648.27, "text": "And we'll come back for her."}
{"index": 102, "start": 2648.77, "end": 2651.07, "text": "First, we lead the Necron's dogs on a wild chase."}
{"index": 103, "start": 2651.53, "end": 2651.93, "text": "Come."}
{"index": 104, "start": 2652.33, "end": 2706.1, "text": "We'll take our stand up there."}
{"index": 105, "start": 2706.42, "end": 2706.82, "text": "Come."}
{"index": 106, "start": 2714.44, "end": 2714.84, "text": "Enough."}
{"index": 107, "start": 2715.96, "end": 2718.64, "text": "I want you to go to Necron and to his mother, Juliana."}
{"index": 108, "start": 2720.42, "end": 2721.4, "text": "We must negotiate."}
{"index": 109, "start": 2721.76, "end": 2722.54, "text": "With the enemy?"}
{"index": 110, "start": 2723.66, "end": 2725.3, "text": "No man is wholly evil."}
{"index": 111, "start": 2725.36, "end": 2727.4, "text": "Surely there is some way to appeal to Necron."}
{"index": 112, "start": 2727.62, "end": 2728.82, "text": "You expect his mercy?"}
{"index": 113, "start": 2730.76, "end": 2731.64, "text": "Father, do you know"}
{"index": 114, "start": 2731.64, "end": 2734.38, "text": "what he will do if I enter his land under a flag of truce?"}
{"index": 115, "start": 2734.56, "end": 2735.64, "text": "We have no choice."}
{"index": 116, "start": 2736.44, "end": 2737.7, "text": "We must take that risk."}
{"index": 117, "start": 2737.78, "end": 2739.22, "text": "You must take that risk, my son."}
{"index": 118, "start": 2740.1, "end": 2741.46, "text": "For the sake of Firekeep."}
{"index": 119, "start": 2742.26, "end": 2743.6, "text": "For the sake of your sister."}
{"index": 120, "start": 2745.76, "end": 2746.2, "text": "Go."}
{"index": 121, "start": 2747.7, "end": 2748.48, "text": "Ride swiftly."}
{"index": 122, "start": 2774.88, "end": 2776.32, "text": "Welcome to my heart."}
{"index": 123, "start": 2776.76, "end": 2779.94, "text": "I am Ro'Leal, and these woods are my home."}
{"index": 124, "start": 2780.68, "end": 2783.2, "text": "Oh, you've had a trying journey."}
{"index": 125, "start": 2784.58, "end": 2786.82, "text": "Please, let me give you some food and drink."}
{"index": 126, "start": 2787.44, "end": 2788.58, "text": "First, you shall rest."}
{"index": 127, "start": 2788.9, "end": 2789.7, "text": "Then we will talk."}
{"index": 128, "start": 2791.95, "end": 2793.55, "text": "Poor, poor darling."}
{"index": 129, "start": 2794.09, "end": 2797.27, "text": "The great Artois frighten you."}
{"index": 130, "start": 2797.65, "end": 2799.37, "text": "You mustn't be afraid."}
{"index": 131, "start": 2799.91, "end": 2801.89, "text": "He's as gentle as a child."}
{"index": 132, "start": 2808.67, "end": 2811.25, "text": "I saw him twist a chain apart with his bare hands."}
{"index": 133, "start": 2811.51, "end": 2814.19, "text": "Oh, yes, he is strong, my sweet."}
{"index": 134, "start": 2815.37, "end": 2817.43, "text": "But he means well, my darling."}
{"index": 135, "start": 2817.55, "end": 2819.31, "text": "He brought you to me, did he not?"}
{"index": 136, "start": 2826.2, "end": 2827.56, "text": "I'm so tired."}
{"index": 137, "start": 2827.84, "end": 2831.12, "text": "Oh, yes, my poor, poor darling."}
{"index": 138, "start": 2832.0, "end": 2832.56, "text": "Yes."}
{"index": 139, "start": 2832.56, "end": 2866.72, "text": "Yes, you're so tired and so beautiful, you must tell me your secrets, Necron."}
{"index": 140, "start": 2870.3, "end": 2872.74, "text": "Necron, the girl has wanted..."}
{"index": 141, "start": 2885.15, "end": 2887.65, "text": "Perhaps I can turn this to my advantage."}
{"index": 142, "start": 2889.84, "end": 2895.78, "text": "Artois, my son, go and bring the subhumans, Necron's dogs."}
{"index": 143, "start": 2896.28, "end": 2898.64, "text": "Tell them we have the girl that he wants."}
{"index": 144, "start": 2901.04, "end": 2904.28, "text": "Tell them he can have her for a price."}
{"index": 145, "start": 2933.82, "end": 2934.46, "text": "Yes."}
{"index": 146, "start": 2934.56, "end": 2934.6, "text": "Yes."}
{"index": 147, "start": 2934.62, "end": 2940.33, "text": "Get out of here."}
{"index": 148, "start": 2940.37, "end": 2940.89, "text": "Get out of here."}
{"index": 149, "start": 2940.89, "end": 2940.93, "text": "No."}
{"index": 150, "start": 2941.33, "end": 2941.97, "text": "No."}
{"index": 151, "start": 2941.97, "end": 2943.41, "text": "The hell you won't."}
{"index": 152, "start": 2943.41, "end": 2944.53, "text": "Go find the girl."}
{"index": 153, "start": 2974.71, "end": 2983.82, "text": "Enter, my son, it is not barred."}
{"index": 154, "start": 2984.02, "end": 2990.63, "text": "What's wrong with you?"}
{"index": 155, "start": 2990.69, "end": 2991.67, "text": "Where are the dogs?"}
{"index": 156, "start": 2994.21, "end": 2995.73, "text": "Where are the dogs?"}
{"index": 157, "start": 3016.98, "end": 3020.48, "text": "Where are the dogs?"}
{"index": 158, "start": 3020.92, "end": 3061.3, "text": "Why do the living disturb the sleep of the dead?"}
{"index": 159, "start": 3061.72, "end": 3064.8, "text": "Why do the living disturb the sleep of the dead?"}
{"index": 160, "start": 3064.8, "end": 3067.12, "text": "I seek a girl."}
{"index": 161, "start": 3067.4, "end": 3068.16, "text": "Tigra."}
{"index": 162, "start": 3069.02, "end": 3070.16, "text": "A girl."}
{"index": 163, "start": 3072.88, "end": 3075.56, "text": "She did this to me."}
{"index": 164, "start": 3076.14, "end": 3082.73, "text": "She and Necron did Necron..."}
{"index": 165, "start": 3082.73, "end": 3084.89, "text": "I find her."}
{"index": 166, "start": 3088.23, "end": 3089.67, "text": "Why should I answer?"}
{"index": 167, "start": 3090.15, "end": 3092.47, "text": "For revenge against Necron."}
{"index": 168, "start": 3096.72, "end": 3097.48, "text": "Necron."}
{"index": 169, "start": 3097.84, "end": 3102.94, "text": "They take her to Agatha."}
{"index": 170, "start": 3103.38, "end": 3106.38, "text": "And from there to the icy king's realm."}
{"index": 171, "start": 3107.8, "end": 3108.76, "text": "Avenge me."}
{"index": 172, "start": 3156.5, "end": 3157.4, "text": "My brother, Necron."}
{"index": 173, "start": 3157.4, "end": 3163.92, "text": "Prince, all is arranged. I've hired a ship. It waits for us at the dock. Necron waits at Ice Peak."}
{"index": 174, "start": 3164.3, "end": 3177.15, "text": "If you scum, we must be well on our way before sunrise."}
{"index": 175, "start": 3177.97, "end": 3192.96, "text": "Why have you brought me?"}
{"index": 176, "start": 3196.29, "end": 3203.2, "text": "This is your bride, my son. She will be mother to your sons."}
{"index": 177, "start": 3203.42, "end": 3210.54, "text": "How thoughtful, mother. I need no bride and no sons."}
{"index": 178, "start": 3211.88, "end": 3213.3, "text": "But you need heirs."}
{"index": 179, "start": 3213.3, "end": 3215.1, "text": "I need nothing."}
{"index": 180, "start": 3216.68, "end": 3227.29, "text": "Necron, Necron, you're a great power in the world."}
{"index": 181, "start": 3228.49, "end": 3231.35, "text": "You have all that any man ever wants or needed."}
{"index": 182, "start": 3232.95, "end": 3234.13, "text": "And yet you despair."}
{"index": 183, "start": 3235.91, "end": 3237.73, "text": "For there is one thing you lack."}
{"index": 184, "start": 3240.32, "end": 3243.76, "text": "One gift that only you can bestow between our people."}
{"index": 185, "start": 3245.62, "end": 3246.14, "text": "Peace."}
{"index": 186, "start": 3247.48, "end": 3249.98, "text": "This is the gift that heals the heart of the giver."}
{"index": 187, "start": 3251.82, "end": 3252.34, "text": "Necron."}
{"index": 188, "start": 3253.26, "end": 3254.74, "text": "I extend my hand in friendship."}
{"index": 189, "start": 3255.6, "end": 3258.28, "text": "I offer peace between our people."}
{"index": 190, "start": 3259.22, "end": 3260.58, "text": "Will you not take my hand?"}
{"index": 191, "start": 3265.44, "end": 3266.72, "text": "Will you not call me friend?"}
{"index": 192, "start": 3302.78, "end": 3303.42, "text": "Necron."}
{"index": 193, "start": 3303.92, "end": 3316.38, "text": "Woman, I spit on you."}
{"index": 194, "start": 3323.19, "end": 3325.93, "text": "This time you present me with one of your little sluts, mother dear."}
{"index": 195, "start": 3326.75, "end": 3328.87, "text": "I'll squash you like a bug."}
{"index": 196, "start": 3329.15, "end": 3335.27, "text": "Get that garbage out of here."}
{"index": 197, "start": 3335.53, "end": 3395.53, "text": "We pay no heed to such trash."}
{"index": 198, "start": 3471.57, "end": 3476.53, "text": "We have come, Lord Necron, to negotiate between our two peoples."}
{"index": 199, "start": 3476.67, "end": 3482.17, "text": "And the return to fire keep of my sister Tigra, whom your warriors basely kidnapped."}
{"index": 200, "start": 3482.37, "end": 3489.11, "text": "My father, King Jero, has empowered me to offer a peace between our kingdoms."}
{"index": 201, "start": 3490.41, "end": 3495.13, "text": "In exchange for his continued sovereignty and my sister's freedom."}
{"index": 202, "start": 3495.83, "end": 3500.57, "text": "It seems to me that my envoys made a similar offer not long since."}
{"index": 203, "start": 3501.75, "end": 3505.29, "text": "And that it was spurned by your illustrious sire."}
{"index": 204, "start": 3505.61, "end": 3510.19, "text": "You know full well, Necron, that offer was made before your minions kidnapped my sister."}
{"index": 205, "start": 3510.47, "end": 3517.77, "text": "I fear, good prince, I cannot offer peace to a people who have refused to proclaim me their rightful overlord."}
{"index": 206, "start": 3518.09, "end": 3523.0, "text": "As to your sister..."}
{"index": 207, "start": 3524.02, "end": 3530.72, "text": "Well, I must admit that until this moment, the idea of mating with her filled me with loathing."}
{"index": 208, "start": 3531.04, "end": 3532.8, "text": "Perhaps I should reconsider."}
{"index": 209, "start": 3534.18, "end": 3538.12, "text": "Your sister, after all, is not wholly unattractive, hm?"}
{"index": 210, "start": 3539.38, "end": 3541.2, "text": "As lesser beasts go."}
{"index": 211, "start": 3542.48, "end": 3560.5, "text": "Who do you think you are?"}
{"index": 212, "start": 3561.36, "end": 3563.72, "text": "And like a pig shall you die?"}
{"index": 213, "start": 3564.18, "end": 3673.03, "text": "You interest me."}
{"index": 214, "start": 3673.83, "end": 3674.51, "text": "Guards!"}
{"index": 215, "start": 3674.63, "end": 3675.25, "text": "Guards!"}
{"index": 216, "start": 3675.49, "end": 3676.17, "text": "Guards!"}
{"index": 217, "start": 3676.25, "end": 3676.47, "text": "Guards!"}
{"index": 218, "start": 3676.49, "end": 3677.51, "text": "Bring him to me."}
{"index": 219, "start": 3683.18, "end": 3684.14, "text": "Release him."}
{"index": 220, "start": 3685.44, "end": 3698.89, "text": "You killed my people."}
{"index": 221, "start": 3699.53, "end": 3702.99, "text": "We've had to dispose of so many undesirables of late."}
{"index": 222, "start": 3704.43, "end": 3795.8, "text": "They'll fight in him."}
{"index": 223, "start": 3796.1, "end": 3858.87, "text": "Is that you?"}
{"index": 224, "start": 3860.81, "end": 3861.79, "text": "Tigra, are you all right?"}
{"index": 225, "start": 3861.97, "end": 3863.65, "text": "Yes, I'm trying to unlock the door."}
{"index": 226, "start": 3863.85, "end": 3865.37, "text": "Never mind the door. You've got to get out of here."}
{"index": 227, "start": 3865.51, "end": 3868.17, "text": "I'm not leaving without you. Maybe I can get a key somehow."}
{"index": 228, "start": 3868.59, "end": 3869.75, "text": "No, Tigra, don't!"}
{"index": 229, "start": 3880.67, "end": 4041.23, "text": "It was my son you saw."}
{"index": 230, "start": 4041.51, "end": 4043.7, "text": "Prince Taro."}
{"index": 231, "start": 4044.7, "end": 4045.54, "text": "He died."}
{"index": 232, "start": 4045.54, "end": 4049.25, "text": "But what about Tigra?"}
{"index": 233, "start": 4050.39, "end": 4051.55, "text": "He's got her, too."}
{"index": 234, "start": 4051.71, "end": 4052.95, "text": "Maybe she's still alive."}
{"index": 235, "start": 4053.61, "end": 4054.61, "text": "It's a chance."}
{"index": 236, "start": 4054.93, "end": 4056.29, "text": "Believe what you want."}
{"index": 237, "start": 4056.73, "end": 4058.49, "text": "But that glacier's a fact."}
{"index": 238, "start": 4061.2, "end": 4064.06, "text": "For three days and nights, it's been pushing south."}
{"index": 239, "start": 4064.64, "end": 4068.18, "text": "A thousand souls lost because of Necron's rage."}
{"index": 240, "start": 4069.16, "end": 4070.26, "text": "Firekeep is next."}
{"index": 241, "start": 4070.74, "end": 4072.0, "text": "We must attack."}
{"index": 242, "start": 4072.34, "end": 4074.18, "text": "I need the Dragonhawks."}
{"index": 243, "start": 4074.44, "end": 4076.18, "text": "The Dragonhawks are too few."}
{"index": 244, "start": 4076.52, "end": 4077.96, "text": "Enough to get in with."}
{"index": 245, "start": 4078.18, "end": 4079.72, "text": "One of us might get through."}
{"index": 246, "start": 4080.28, "end": 4081.36, "text": "I'll destroy you."}
{"index": 247, "start": 4082.58, "end": 4084.66, "text": "But if that glacier passes beyond the river,"}
{"index": 248, "start": 4084.78, "end": 4085.92, "text": "I will have no choice."}
{"index": 249, "start": 4087.04, "end": 4088.58, "text": "I will have to release the lava."}
{"index": 250, "start": 4088.86, "end": 4636.45, "text": "It's over, don't you see?"}
{"index": 251, "start": 4637.01, "end": 4638.33, "text": "We have to start over."}
{"index": 252, "start": 4638.53, "end": 4638.97, "text": "THE DRAGONHAUKS"}
